Third-party components
======================

The patch bundle and the patched app include third-party code and fonts:

- AndroidX Media3 1.11.1 and its runtime dependencies (AndroidX, Guava,
  Error Prone annotations, J2ObjC annotations, JSR 305, Kotlin standard
  library, kotlinx-coroutines, JetBrains annotations): Apache License 2.0.
  Relocated under the dev.utaa.cutlog.shaded package.
- Checker Framework qualifiers (checker-qual 3.43.0): MIT License.
- M PLUS Rounded 1c, Dela Gothic One, Yusei Magic, DotGothic16:
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.

The full list with versions, copyright notices and license texts is in
patches/src/main/resources/cutlog/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt (also packaged in
the .mpp and added to the patched app as res/raw/cutlog_third_party_notices.txt).
Font copyright notices and the OFL text are in
patches/src/main/resources/cutlog/fonts/LICENSE.txt.

